### GET /feed/channel?channel_name= — page 1 (canal real com 41 videos, > 1 pagina)
# Esperado: 200, {docs, total: 41, itemsPerPage: 30}, docs.length = 30.
GET {{baseUrl}}/feed/channel?channel_name=Cássio Batista Pereira&page=1

### GET /feed/channel?channel_name= — page 2 (resto: 41 - 30 = 11)
GET {{baseUrl}}/feed/channel?channel_name=Cássio Batista Pereira&page=2

### GET /feed/channel?channel_name= — canal com 1 pagina so (Zurubabel, 4 videos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/feed/channel?channel_name=Zurubabel

### GET /feed/channel?channel_name= — canal inexistente
# Esperado: 200, {docs: [], total: 0, itemsPerPage: 30} — nao propaga erro (diferente do
# VideoController.index original, que quebraria com `channel.link` de um `null`; nao e
# comportamento a preservar, ver src/functions/video/byChannel.ts).
GET {{baseUrl}}/feed/channel?channel_name=NaoExiste
